MCAMUI-TOOLS 1
# apprenticeCAM starter library - standard metric tools (our own data, not from Mastercam).
# Geometry: jobber drills DIN 338, stub carbide end mills DIN 6527 K, taps ISO metric coarse, typical catalogue
# spot / chamfer / ball sizes. 'BASE defaults': speeds, feeds, holder and the other fields come from each type's
# default tool in your Mastercam DatabaseDefaults.tooldb at load (viewer/toollib.c load_text), as a new tool would.
